  "description": "The Londonderry bike is our low step-through model. Named after Annie Londonderry, the first woman to bicycle around the world in 1894; this design provides a smoother ride, with a more comfortable upright seated position. The Londonderry is the perfect blend of function and comfort. The high, seat position provides great visibility, while the low-step design makes getting on and off the bike easy. Get around town in style and comfort. Like Annie, feel fearless to explore and go everywhere!",
